WEBVTT

NOTE Actual app components with demonstration data. No real sends.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.800
Agreement to reviewed rates — demonstration

1
00:00:02.800 --> 00:00:10.570
Open Practice, then Contracts.

2
00:00:10.570 --> 00:00:18.787
The Agreements screen holds the terms used for billing.

3
00:00:18.787 --> 00:00:29.592
Add the facility, recipient and dates, then the rate types your agreement actually uses.

4
00:00:29.592 --> 00:00:39.015
Check the billing increment, any stipend coverage and overage terms.

5
00:00:39.015 --> 00:00:49.368
These fields drive your invoices, so compare them with the agreement before using them.

6
00:00:49.368 --> 00:00:56.800
Select the reviewed agreement in Work.

00:00:56.800 --> 00:01:00.000
Try it with your own records. Review the result.
